# Presentation material, deliberately not part of what gets uploaded: only the
# software documentation is. These stay in the working tree and stay in sync
# with the code -- they are just not tracked. (They exist in history before
# this point; untracking stops future commits, it does not remove the past.)
docs/*.pptx
docs/PPT規劃.txt
docs/DEMO_SCRIPT_zh-TW.md
docs/PRESENTATION_NOTES_zh-TW.md
